WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.439 --> 00:00:03.989
Lesson three. My Family and Friends!

2
00:00:04.938 --> 00:00:12.238
Hello, hello! Hello, hello! Wave your hand, and say hello! Hello!

3
00:00:13.193 --> 00:00:14.871
Coco, what do we learn today?

4
00:00:14.921 --> 00:00:18.734
Today we learn: My Family and Friends! Let's go!

5
00:00:20.275 --> 00:00:23.625
Mother! Say it with me. Mother!

6
00:00:27.568 --> 00:00:30.968
Father! Say it with me. Father!

7
00:00:35.029 --> 00:00:38.762
Grandma! Say it with me. Grandma!

8
00:00:42.727 --> 00:00:46.711
Grandpa! Say it with me. Grandpa!

9
00:00:50.749 --> 00:00:54.433
Uncle! Say it with me. Uncle!

10
00:00:58.407 --> 00:01:01.841
Aunt! Say it with me. Aunt!

11
00:01:05.800 --> 00:01:09.134
Cousin! Say it with me. Cousin!

12
00:01:13.119 --> 00:01:16.336
Friend! Say it with me. Friend!

13
00:01:20.389 --> 00:01:26.359
Listen. This is my uncle. This is my aunt.

14
00:01:26.409 --> 00:01:30.619
Say it with me. This is my uncle. This is my aunt.

15
00:01:35.367 --> 00:01:41.613
Grandma tells wonderful stories every evening. My uncle and aunt visit us too.

16
00:01:41.663 --> 00:01:43.067
I like this story!

17
00:01:43.785 --> 00:01:48.084
What's this?

18
00:01:48.134 --> 00:01:49.580
It's a grandma!

19
00:01:50.563 --> 00:01:54.939
What's this?

20
00:01:54.989 --> 00:01:56.367
It's an aunt!

21
00:01:57.317 --> 00:02:06.234
This is E. E is for egg. E is for elephant. This is F. F is for fish. F is for frog.

22
00:02:10.224 --> 00:02:17.275
Bye-bye, bye-bye! See you soon! Wave your hand. Bye-bye, bye-bye!

23
00:02:17.325 --> 00:02:19.032
Bye-bye, friends!

